  - m_Id: 351368222412800
    m_Localized: Next
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 351591791398912
    m_Localized: "Welcome to the VR Lecture Viewer! \n\nThis program lets you view
      recorded lectures in a virtual environment, interact with a virtual assistant,
      and explore lectures using various tools.\n\nFirst, open the main menu using
      the button on your controller!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 352870139760640
    m_Localized: Browsing Lectures
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 352952167763968
    m_Localized: "Here you will learn how to select and open a lecture.\n\nFrom the\_Main
      Menu, press the\_ \u201CLectures\u201D\_button. This opens the lecture browser
      window.\n\nSelect a lecture from the list and open it. \n\nThis will load the
      video lecture in the virtual space."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 353444633579520
    m_Localized: Lecture Playback
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 353982276243456
    m_Localized: "Control how your lecture is played with intuitive controls.\n\nUse
      the\_Playback Controls Window\_to navigate the lecture (play, pause, skip,
      or seek).\n\nCustomize settings like playback speed, font size, or subtitle
      language!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 354480542781440
    m_Localized: Transcripts and Translations
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 354808390553600
    m_Localized: 'Read or follow along with the spoken content via transcript or
      translation.


      Press The "Transcript" button in the bottom right of the
      player!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 355444930711552
    m_Localized: AI Assistant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 355479298838528
    m_Localized: "You can ask the avatar questions during lecture playback.\n\nPress\_the
      \u201CAsk Avatar\u201D\_button in the bottom right.\n\nYou can enter the question
      or speak it aloud using the microphone button!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 356416369266688
    m_Localized: Tutorial Completed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 356419733098496
    m_Localized: 'You have completed the tutorial!


      Have fun learning!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 356424422330368
    m_Localized: Finish
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
